## Quick Start

```javascript
import { LineChart } from 'dataviz-pro';

const chart = new LineChart('#container', {
  data: [1, 4, 2, 8, 5],
  labels: ['Jan', 'Feb', 'Mar', 'Apr', 'May']
});

chart.render();
```

That's it! You now have a working line chart. [See it in action →](https://example.com/demo)
